{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29497","headline":"酬崔八早梅有赠兼示之作 · 李商隐","name":"酬崔八早梅有赠兼示之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"知访寒梅过野塘，久留金勒爲回肠。\n谢郎衣袖初翻雪，荀令熏炉更换香。\n何处拂胸资蝶粉，几时涂额藉蜂黄。\n维摩一室虽多病，亦要天花作道场。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29497.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29497","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}